  "markdown": "Form 1065\nDepartment of the Treasury\nInternal Revenue Service\n\n\nU.S. Return of Partnership Income\n\n\nFor calendar year 2023, or tax year beginning 01/01, 2023, ending 12/31, 20 23. \nGo to www.irs.gov/Form1065 for instructions and the latest information. \n\nOMB No. 1545-0123\n2023\n\n\nA Principal business activity \nSofware \nB Principal product or service \nSample \nC Business code number \n12345 \n\n<table>\n<tr><td rowspan=\"3\">Type<br>or<br>Print</td><td>Name of partnership<br>Sample Software Service</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Number, street, and room or suite no. If a P.O. box, see instructions.<br>123 Fake Memorial Ave., Unit #1</td></tr>\n<tr><td>City or town, state or province, country, and ZIP or foreign postal code<br>Sample City, NY, 12345-6789</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nEmployer identification number: 12-3456789 \nDate business started: 12/01/2000 \nTotal assets (see instructions): $ 50,000.00 \n\nG Check applicable boxes: \n[x] (1) Initial return\n[ ] (2) Final return\n[x] (3) Name change\n[ ] (4) Address change\n[ ] (5) Amended return\nH Check accounting method: \n[x] (1) Cash\n[ ] (2) Accrual\n[ ] (3) Other (specify): ___\nI Number of Schedules K-1. Attach one for each person who was a partner at any time during the tax year: 1 \nJ Check if Schedules C and M-3 are attached ... [x] \nK Check if partnership: \n[x] (1) Aggregated activities for section 465 at-risk purposes\n[ ] (2) Grouped activities for section 469 passive activity purposes\n\n<table>\n<tr><td colspan=\"6\">**Caution:** Include **only** trade or business income and expenses on lines 1a through 23 below. See instructions for more information.</td></tr>\n<tr><td rowspan=\"8\">Income</td><td>1a</td><td colspan=\"2\">Gross receipts or sales 1,000.00 b Less returns and allowances 1,000.00 c Balance</td><td>1c</td><td>2,000.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td colspan=\"2\">Cost of goods sold (attach Form 1125-A) ...</td><td>2</td><td>1,000.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td colspan=\"2\